{
  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-10","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"proof_outline","difficulty":"hit","question":"设连续函数满足 f(x+y)=f(x)f(y)，且f(1)=2，证明f(x)=2^x.","answer":"对任意实数x，f(x)=2^x.","ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["函数复合","函数方程"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 先证有理数处结论，再用连续性延拓到实数."},{"id":"s2","text":"由f(x+1)=2f(x)得f(0)=1."},{"id":"s3","text":"由f(1)=f(1/n)^n得f(1/n)=2^{1/n}."},{"id":"s4","text":"从而对有理数m/n有f(m/n)=2^{m/n}."},{"id":"s5","text":"有理数稠密且f连续，故对任意实数x成立."}],"final_answer":"$f(x)=2^x$. ","techniques_used":["函数复合","函数方程"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"函数复合","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"函数方程","expected":"$f(x)=2^x$."}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例10*","page":13,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example","starred":true}}
